@startuml

title State diagram for BPO Management System Search Functionality

[*] --> InitialSearchState

state "Initial Search" as InitialSearchState
InitialSearchState : entry / start state
InitialSearchState : do / display initial search options

state "Filter by Category" as FilterCategory
FilterCategory : entry / user selects category filter
FilterCategory : do / apply category filter and display results

state "Filter by Price Range" as FilterPriceRange
FilterPriceRange : entry / user selects price range filter
FilterPriceRange : do / apply price range filter and display results

InitialSearchState --> FilterCategory : Select Category Filter
InitialSearchState --> FilterPriceRange : Select Price Range Filter

FilterCategory --> DisplayResults : Apply Filter
FilterPriceRange --> DisplayResults : Apply Filter

DisplayResults : entry / display matching users based on chosen criteria
DisplayResults : do / show search results
DisplayResults : exit / user can view or interact with results

DisplayResults --> [*] : Back to Initial Search

@enduml
